WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit with the legs swept gently to the left, ankles resting near the right hip.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Sit tall and lengthen upward through the crown of the head.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
On an exhale, twist the torso softly to the right.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Rest the left hand on the right knee and the right hand behind you.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Keep the twist easy and even, then release and switch sides.
